            <ArticleTitle>Pain management in advanced cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>793-805</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents a primary care approach to pain management in patients with advanced cancer. Assessment of &quot;total&quot; pain is reviewed along with interdisciplinary care. Pharmacologic and nonpharmacologic therapies are outlined, with emphasis on the correct use of narcotics and adjuvant analgesics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
